Plaintext
Hello GlobalStore.com Support Team, I would like to purchase the following subscription:

Country: Kuwait
Service: [Subscription Name]
Duration: [Selected Duration: 1 Month / 1 Year]
Price: [Calculated Price in KD]

Please provide payment details and complete my order.
