7. Non-Functional & Technical Requirements
WhatsApp Deep Linking: Built using standard [https://wa.me/](https://wa.me/) format for universal app/browser launching.
Email Service Integration: Node.js/SMTP transactional email configuration to deliver complaint tickets with attached image files to global2stor2@gmail.com.
RTL/LTR Support: Clean stylesheet toggling for smooth Arabic rendering.
